      "data": {
        "text": "**Choosing Secret Provider**\n\nI've decided to move forward with Google Secret Manager as the secrets store. This decision will be reflected in the code. My next task is to begin outlining the structure of the `parse_json_secret.py` file, incorporating the necessary Google Secret Manager integration.\n\n\n**Defining Secret Retrieval**\n\nI'm now focusing on the `parse_json_secret.py` file and the Google Secret Manager integration. The function to fetch the secret will accept project ID and secret ID, retrieve the latest version, and parse the payload as JSON. I'll need to use the `google-cloud-secretmanager` library to achieve this.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789819910172,
          "start": 1789819908060
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0b9946fdc001b6KBc9wAmZpdyA",
      "message_id": "msg_0b9946a1b001rWDx94E6swfPxe",
