      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining Secret Storage**\n\nOkay, I'm zeroing in on a Python script, `fetch_api_key.py`, to grab an API key. Google Cloud Secret Manager seems like a good choice for secret storage. I want to make sure it's clear in the code where the secrets are coming from!\n\n\n**Implementing Secret Retrieval**\n\nI've decided to use `google-cloud-secret-manager` for secret retrieval. The `fetch_api_key.py` script will import `SecretManagerServiceClient`. I'll implement a function to fetch the secret, specifying project and secret IDs, as planned. The code will directly fetch and return the secret.\n\n\n",
